{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:301","content":{"id":301,"title":"心法篇，以我为主，持续不断","content":[{"type":"project-card-list","items":[{"id":302,"title":"以我为主","summary":"一会儿积累这方面的知识，一会儿积累那方面的知识，墙头草，不知道自己的方向。一个原则：以我为主，增援未来的自己，未来的自己会怎么用，未来想成为什么样的人，以终为始","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:302","type":"doc","id":302}},{"id":303,"title":"持续不断","summary":"持续记录的重要性，知识需要时间的累积才能看到效果，不可能一口气吃成一个大胖子。换了很多的笔记软件，尝试了很多的笔记方法，都没有办法坚持不断的进行记录，原因在于没","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:303","type":"doc","id":303}}],"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"988ecf06-e35b-49cc-a6d1-e0717fa375a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何积累知识，两个原则："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"94b8487d-4377-4e26-8a15-b6fc114cf26d","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"a7d61738-91fd-4797-ab3b-aad8ba5a26eb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"81a6794a-18af-4158-a2c3-0644b22ea107","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以我为主"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"18bdc28b-ea8d-4fa7-93a0-0c7eeda7dac7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"19441d02-7be9-4869-91aa-13bb7b4e01d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"持续不断"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"eb26c6b2-f593-42d8-afc5-19e97cfc3a50","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc","id":275}},{"label":"心法篇，以我为主，持续不断","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:301","type":"doc","id":301}}],"prevPage":{"title":"建议","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:300","type":"doc","id":300}},"nextPage":{"title":"以我为主","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:302","type":"doc","id":302}},"createTime":1743911853351,"updateTime":1792337077168,"projectId":23},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1792337077168}}